CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/d com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/CommandControllerCachedCommandPath
	COMMENT Cached path for one unit of a command group: Path a, unit id b, start c/d, target e/f, an int g (team/step id) and MovementType h. Serialized with the owning CommandControllerCommand. [behaviour verified]
	FIELD a path Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/k/k;
	FIELD b unitId J
	FIELD c startX F
	FIELD d startY F
	FIELD e targetX F
	FIELD f targetY F
	FIELD g cachedFrame I
	FIELD h movementType Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/ao;
	METHOD a write (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/j/as;)V
	METHOD a read (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/j/k;)V
